#: src/components/vehiclesetup/configuration/compass/FullCompassCalibrator.vue
msgid ""
"<strong>Onboard Compass Calibration</strong> is the regular calibration "
"used for ArduPilot vehicles. It requires spinning the vehicle around all "
"axes, which allows it to calibrate the readings to the expected local "
"magnetic field."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/vehiclesetup/overview/GyroCalib.vue
msgid ""
"A calibrated gyro should display a value of 0 on all axes when the vehicle "
"is stationary. Symptoms of a mis-calibrated gyro include yaw drift and "
"small attitude offsets."
msgstr ""
"Um giroscópio calibrado deve exibir o valor 0 em todos os eixos quando o "
"veículo estiver parado. Sintomas de um giroscópio mal calibrado incluem "
"deriva de guinada e pequenos desvios de atitude."

