"the best results. While it is not currently implemented here, the compass "
"offset information can be determined in the Log Browser page. Press the "
"green play button on a log file, click the three vertical dots in the "
"sidebar, open the <b>Mag Fit Tool</b>, specify the general global region "
"where the log was created, then click \"Fit\" for each compass you wish to "
"calibrate. Resulting values can be copied across to the COMPASS_* autopilot "
"parameters."
